  "description": "This package contains all the available Telerik Reporting WPF Report Viewer control themes.\n            The XAML themes are required to render the control in the application.\n            The same XAML files are available with the Telerik Reporting installation, for including in the project directly to reduce the application size and to customize the themes if required.\n            This package is part of the Progress® Telerik® Reporting solution.\n\n            IMPORTANT: This is commercial software. To use it, you must agree to the Telerik End User License Agreement for Telerik Reporting (https://www.telerik.com/purchase/license-agreement/reporting-dlw-s).\n            If you do not have a commercial license, the usage of this product is governed by the trial license terms.\n            Telerik Reporting requires activation using a license key — this applies to both the trial and commercial versions of the product.\n\n            Telerik Reporting licenses can be obtained through the Telerik Reporting page (https://www.telerik.com/purchase/individual/reporting). For more information on licensing, configuration, and troubleshooting, refer to the product documentation's License section (https://docs.telerik.com/reporting/licensing/setting-up-your-telerik-reporting-license-key).",
